# The image carries the runtime only: bin, src, templates, spec (see Dockerfile).
# Everything else is noise in the build context — and .docket in particular must
# never be baked into an image, or a record would ship with a container.
.git
.github
.docket
node_modules
test
eval
docs
examples
Dockerfile
# Top-level prose only — `/` is load-bearing here. A bare `*.md` would read as
# "every markdown file", and spec/SPEC.md is COPYed into the image on purpose.
/*.md
